  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is neutral or negative (sentiment ≤ 0.00) to counteract overconfidence.",
    "Increase forecast lag by 1-2 days if recent history shows strong upward momentum and model overreacts.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoot after sharp spikes by applying a 10-15% dampening factor to avoid overcorrection.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast deviates >1.5σ from 30-day moving average, adjust toward historical mean.",
    "For sentiment >0.00, increase forecast sensitivity to recent high prices (last 7 days) to capture bullish momentum.",
    "When sentiment is positive but price is trending down, reduce forecast slope to avoid premature reversal."
